      "message": "In the init, you rely on `protected_pgtable_mem` to know how much data you need in your memcache.\n\nThis is fine ... BUT that means it can fail with `ENOMEM`. As you you can race with page faults that would increase the size of your page-table while you are trying to walk it.\n\nYou\u0027d need here to handle that case, if ENOMEM, then retry with more memory",
